This licence covers what is written for this port that is not part of the game interpreter: the launcher
(launcher/launcher.c), the settings code it shares with the game (shim/dm_settings.c, shim/dm_settings.h,
shim/gamma_tables.h), tools/, build_sf3500.sh, package.sh and the scripts and documents in package-src/.

It does not cover the author's game (game/), the box art, the Fenix interpreter (fenix080/), the rest of shim/,
which is built into that interpreter (GPL version 2 or later; two SDL 1.2 headers there are LGPL), the SF3500
glue and patches (sf3500/), the font data in launcher/font_data.h (DejaVu fonts licence) or the bundled
third-party components: see README.md, licenses/CREDITS.txt and licenses/.
